  "description": "This ontology can assist in the management of mental healthcare networks. It allows the integration and semantic interoperability between independent health databases, promotes the ability to infer knowledge in this domain, enables the generation of relevant indicators for mental health to improve decision-making, and increases mental health management and planning efficiency and effectiveness. This is a non-profit, open-source project.",
